    "summary": "Solves standard divide-and-conquer recurrences $T(n) = aT(n/b) + f(n)$ where $a \\ge 1, b > 1$. Compares $f(n)$ with $n^{\\log_b a}$ across three fundamental cases based on polynomial dominance.",
