    "codeSnippet": "# AVL Tree Minimum Nodes Fibonacci Recurrence\ndef min_avl_nodes(h):\n    if h == 0: return 1\n    if h == 1: return 2\n    a, b = 1, 2\n    for _ in range(2, h + 1):\n        a, b = b, a + b + 1\n    return b",
