    "label": "Doubly & Circular Linked Lists",
    "name": "Doubly & Circular Linked Lists",
    "category": "Linear Data Structures",
    "kind": "definition",
    "summary": "Doubly Linked Lists (DLL) contain two pointers per node (`prev` and `next`), enabling bidirectional traversal and true $O(1)$ node deletion given its pointer. Circular Linked Lists (CLL) link the last node back to the first node, eliminating NULL pointers.",
    "formula": "\\text{DLL: } \\text{node}\\to\\text{next}\\to\\text{prev} == \\text{node}, \\quad \\text{CLL: } \\text{tail}\\to\\text{next} == \\text{head}",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{DLL Node Deletion: } p\\to\\text{prev}\\to\\text{next} = p\\to\\text{next}; \\; p\\to\\text{next}\\to\\text{prev} = p\\to\\text{prev}; \\implies O(1)",
      "\\text{CLL with Tail Pointer: } O(1) \\text{ insertion at both Front and End}",
      "\\text{Memory Overhead: DLL requires extra pointer per node (2 pointers vs 1 in SLL)}"
    ],
    "complexity": "Insertion/Deletion at known pointer: $O(1)$ for DLL/CLL, Traversal: $O(n)$",
    "codeSnippet": "struct DNode {\n    int data;\n    struct DNode *prev, *next;\n};\n\nvoid delete_node(struct DNode **head, struct DNode *del) {\n    if (*head == NULL || del == NULL) return;\n    if (*head == del) *head = del->next;\n    if (del->next != NULL) del->next->prev = del->prev;\n    if (del->prev != NULL) del->prev->next = del->next;\n    free(del); // True O(1) deletion with node pointer!\n}",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"35\" width=\"80\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#38BDF8\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"58\" fill=\"#0F172A\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#22C55E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"170,41 178,45 170,49\" fill=\"#22C55E\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#F59E0B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"120,56 112,60 120,64\" fill=\"#F59E0B\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"35\" width=\"80\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#38BDF8\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"58\" fill=\"#0F172A\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"58\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">DLL: O(1) Delete</text></svg>",
