    "kind": "algorithm",
    "summary": "Last-In First-Out (LIFO) abstract data type. Primary operations are `push`, `pop`, `peek`/`top`, and `isEmpty`. Implemented via contiguous arrays with `top` index, or dynamic singly linked lists with head push/pop.",
    "formula": "\\text{Total valid permutation sequences for } n \\text{ elements: Catalan Number } C_n = \\frac{1}{n+1} \\binom{2n}{n}",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{Valid Stack Permutations: } C_n = \\frac{1}{n+1} \\binom{2n}{n}",
      "\\text{Two Stacks in One Array: Grow Stack 1 from left } (top1 = -1) \\text{ and Stack 2 from right } (top2 = n)",
      "\\text{Overflow Condition in 2-Stack Array: } top1 + 1 == top2"
    ],
    "complexity": "Push, Pop, Peek: Strictly $O(1)$ time, Space: $O(n)$",
    "codeSnippet": "#define MAX 100\nstruct Stack {\n    int arr[MAX];\n    int top;\n};\nvoid init(struct Stack *s) { s->top = -1; }\nint isEmpty(struct Stack *s) { return s->top == -1; }\nint isFull(struct Stack *s) { return s->top == MAX - 1; }\nvoid push(struct Stack *s, int val) {\n    if (!isFull(s)) s->arr[++(s->top)] = val;\n}\nint pop(struct Stack *s) {\n    if (!isEmpty(s)) return s->arr[(s->top)--];\n    return -1; // Underflow\n}",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 130\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"130\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"20\" width=\"120\" height=\"90\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"75\" width=\"100\" height=\"25\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#38BDF8\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"92\" fill=\"#0F172A\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"45\" width=\"100\" height=\"25\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#22C55E\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#0F172A\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20 (top)</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Push: top++ | Pop: top--</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"75\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Catalan Sequences: C_n</text></svg>",
