    "summary": "Non-linear hierarchical data structure. Types include Strict/Full Binary Tree (every node has 0 or 2 children), Complete Binary Tree (all levels filled except possibly last, filled from left), and Perfect Binary Tree (all internal nodes have 2 children and all leaves at same level).",
    "formula": "n_0 = n_2 + 1 \\quad (\\text{In ANY binary tree, Leaf count } = \\text{Degree-2 node count } + 1)",
