    "codeSnippet": "#include <stdio.h>\n#define BAD_SQR(x) x * x\n#define GOOD_SQR(x) ((x) * (x))\n\nint main() {\n    int a = 2;\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", BAD_SQR(a + 1));  // 2 + 1 * 2 + 1 = 5! (TRAP!)\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", GOOD_SQR(a + 1)); // ((2+1) * (2+1)) = 9 (Correct!)\n    return 0;\n}",
