    "codeSnippet": "# Construct Expression Tree from Postfix expression in Python\nclass ExpNode:\n    def __init__(self, val, left=None, right=None):\n        self.val = val; self.left = left; self.right = right\n\ndef construct_exp_tree(postfix_tokens):\n    stack = []\n    for t in postfix_tokens:\n        if t in \"+-*/^\":\n            r = stack.pop(); l = stack.pop()\n            stack.append(ExpNode(t, l, r))\n        else:\n            stack.append(ExpNode(t))\n    return stack[0]",
