    "summary": "Step-by-step tracing of AVL balancing rotations. LL imbalance (inserted into left subtree of left child) requires single right rotation at critical node $z$. LR imbalance (inserted into right subtree of left child) requires left rotation at $y$ followed by right rotation at $z$.",
    "formula": "\\text{Critical Node } z: \\text{Lowest ancestor with } |\\text{BF}| > 1",
