    "name": "TLB & Effective Memory Access Time",
    "category": "Memory Management & Virtual Memory",
    "kind": "algorithm",
    "summary": "Hardware associative cache (TLB) storing recently translated Page Table entries. Eliminates extra memory access on TLB hit. Effective Memory Access Time (EMAT) is computed using TLB hit ratio $\\alpha$, TLB access time $t$, and main memory access time $m$.",
    "formula": "\\text{EMAT} = \\alpha(t + m) + (1 - \\alpha)(t + 2m) = t + m + (1 - \\alpha)m",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{Single-Level Paging EMAT: } \\text{EMAT} = \\alpha(t + m) + (1 - \\alpha)(t + 2m)",
      "\\text{Two-Level Paging EMAT: } \\text{EMAT} = \\alpha(t + m) + (1 - \\alpha)(t + 3m)",
      "k\\text{-Level Paging on TLB Miss: Requires } k \\text{ memory accesses for page tables } + 1 \\text{ for data} = (k + 1)m",
      "\\text{Parallel Search: Associative TLB checks all entries simultaneously in } O(1) \\text{ time } t"
    ],
    "complexity": "EMAT: Sub-nanosecond lookup when TLB hit ratio $\\alpha \\ge 98\\%$",
    "codeSnippet": "# EMAT Calculator for Multi-Level Paging in Python\ndef compute_emat(tlb_hit_ratio, tlb_time, mem_time, paging_levels=1):\n    t = tlb_time\n    m = mem_time\n    hit_time = t + m\n    miss_time = t + (paging_levels + 1) * m\n    return tlb_hit_ratio * hit_time + (1 - tlb_hit_ratio) * miss_time",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 130\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"130\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"25\" y=\"20\" width=\"180\" height=\"85\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#22C55E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TLB Hit (\u03b1)</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Access Time = t + m</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"88\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1 Memory Access</text><rect x=\"255\" y=\"20\" width=\"180\" height=\"85\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#EF4444\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#EF4444\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TLB Miss (1 - \u03b1)</text><text x=\"345\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Access Time = t + 2m</text><text x=\"345\" y=\"88\" fill=\"#EF4444\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2 Memory Accesses</text></svg>",
