    "codeSnippet": "# Effective Access Time with Page Fault Rate in Python\ndef calculate_eat(mem_access_ns, page_fault_rate, pf_service_ns=8000000):\n    return (1 - page_fault_rate) * mem_access_ns + page_fault_rate * pf_service_ns\n# e.g. 100ns RAM, 1 per 1000 faults: 0.999*100 + 0.001*8,000,000 = 8099.9 ns",
