    "chapterId": "cn-datalink",
    "label": "Stop-and-Wait ARQ",
    "kind": "algorithm",
    "summary": "Sender transmits one frame and waits for an ACK. If ACK doesn't arrive within timeout, frame is retransmitted. Link utilization = T_frame / (T_frame + 2 * T_prop + T_ack). Numbered sequence (0/1) handles duplicate ACKs/data.",
    "formula": "U = \\frac{1}{1 + 2a}",
