    "id": "c-cn-tcp-congestion-control",
    "subjectId": "Computer Networks",
    "chapterId": "cn-transport",
    "label": "TCP Congestion Control",
    "kind": "algorithm",
    "summary": "Phases: Slow Start (cwnd doubles every RTT until ssthresh), Congestion Avoidance (cwnd += 1 MSS every RTT - linear growth). On 3 duplicate ACKs: ssthresh = cwnd/2, cwnd = ssthresh (Reno fast recovery); on timeout: ssthresh = cwnd/2, cwnd = 1 MSS (slow start).",
    "formula": "\\text{ssthresh} = \\lceil cwnd / 2 \\rceil",
    "pseudocode": "# TCP Reno cwnd evolution\nms = 1\ncwnd = ms\nssthresh = 8\nrtt = 0\nwhile rtt < 10:\n    if cwnd < ssthresh:\n        cwnd *= 2  # slow start\n    else:\n        cwnd += ms  # congestion avoidance\n    rtt += 1\n    print(f'RTT={rtt}, cwnd={cwnd}')",
    "prerequisites": [],
    "examRelevance": 5,
    "commonTraps": [
      "Slow start doubles per RTT (not per ACK); Congestion Avoidance increases by 1 MSS per RTT.",
      "Tahoe: 3 dup ACK -> cwnd=1 (slow start). Reno: 3 dup ACK -> fast recovery (cwnd = ssthresh)."
    ],
    "pyqIds": [
      "GATE CSE 2017 Set 2",
      "GATE CSE 2019",
      "GATE CSE 2021 Set 1"
    ],
    "imageUrl": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 480 280\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"480\" height=\"280\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#0f172a\">\n    <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#0f172a\"/>\n    <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#0f172a\"/>\n    <text x=\"20\" y=\"30\">cwnd</text>\n    <text x=\"450\" y=\"260\">RTT</text>\n    <polyline points=\"40,240 80,210 120,180 160,150 200,120 200,80 240,90 260,100 280,110 280,80 320,90 340,100 360,110 380,120 400,130 420,140 440,150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"80\" y=\"200\">Slow Start (exp)</text>\n    <text x=\"160\" y=\"115\">SS threshold</text>\n    <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"/>\n    <text x=\"220\" y=\"100\">Congestion Avoidance (linear)</text>\n    <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"/>\n    <text x=\"210\" y=\"78\">loss -> ssthresh = cwnd/2</text>\n    <text x=\"290\" y=\"115\">CA</text>\n    <text x=\"430\" y=\"150\">cwnd</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>",
