      "\\text{Broadcast Domains: Hub = 1, Switch = 1 (unless VLANs configured), Router = M (per port)}",
      "\\text{Backward Learning Algorithm: Unknown destination } \\implies \\text{Flood all ports except ingress port}",
      "\\text{STP Root Bridge Selection: Lowest Bridge ID (Priority + MAC Address)}"
