    "chapterId": "cn-datalink",
    "label": "Point-to-Point Protocol (PPP) & High-Level Data Link Control (HDLC)",
    "name": "HDLC & PPP Protocols",
    "category": "Data Link Layer & Flow Control",
    "kind": "definition",
    "summary": "Standard bit-oriented and byte-oriented data link protocols: 1. HDLC (High-Level Data Link Control): Bit-oriented protocol using Flag pattern `01111110` (0x7E) with Bit Stuffing (sender inserts 0 after five consecutive 1s); Three frame types: I-frames (Information), S-frames (Supervisory: RR, RNR, REJ), U-frames (Unnumbered: SABM, DISC); 2. PPP (Point-to-Point Protocol): Byte-oriented protocol for point-to-point router links; Uses Byte Stuffing (0x7D escape byte); Incorporates LCP (Link Control Protocol) for link establishment/authentication (PAP, CHAP) and NCP (Network Control Protocol) for multi-protocol encapsulation (IPv4, IPv6).",
    "formula": "\\text{Bit Stuffing: } 11111 \\to 111110 \\quad | \\quad \\text{Flag: } 01111110 \\; (0\\text{x7E}) \\quad | \\quad \\text{Byte Stuffing: } 0\\text{x7E} \\to 0\\text{x7D } 0\\text{x5E}",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{HDLC Bit Stuffing: Insert '0' after five consecutive '1's in payload}",
      "\\text{HDLC Frame Structure: Flag (8) | Address (8) | Control (8/16) | Payload | FCS (16/32) | Flag (8)}",
      "\\text{PPP Protocols: LCP (Link setup, PAP/CHAP auth) + NCP (Network protocol negotiation)}",
      "\\text{PPP Framing: Byte-oriented with 0x7E delimiter and 0x7D escape stuffing}"
    ],
    "complexity": "Bit/Byte Stuffing: $O(N)$ streaming scan",
    "codeSnippet": "# HDLC Bit Stuffing in Python\ndef hdlc_bit_stuff(bit_stream):\n    stuffed = ''\n    count_ones = 0\n    for bit in bit_stream:\n        stuffed += bit\n        if bit == '1':\n            count_ones += 1\n            if count_ones == 5:\n                stuffed += '0' # Insert 0 after five 1s\n                count_ones = 0\n        else:\n            count_ones = 0\n    return stuffed\n# Payload with six consecutive 1s: '01111110'\nprint(hdlc_bit_stuff('01111110')) # '011111010'",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"25\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">HDLC Bit Stuffing</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Insert 0 after five consecutive 1s</text><rect x=\"245\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#22C55E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PPP Architecture</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LCP (Link/Auth) + NCP (Network IP)</text></svg>",
