    "formula": "\\eta_{\\text{SW}} = \\frac{N}{1 + 2a} \\quad | \\quad L_{\\min} = 2 \\cdot T_p \\cdot B \\quad | \\quad W = \\min(\\text{cwnd}, \\text{rwnd}) \\quad | \\quad \\text{Offset} = \\frac{\\text{Byte Index}}{8}",
