      "core": "Lattices & Boolean Algebras",
      "branches": [
        "Unique LUB (Join) & GLB (Meet)",
        "Distributive Lattices (Forbidden N5 and M3)",
        "Complemented Lattices (a \u2228 a' = 1, a \u2227 a' = 0)",
        "Boolean Lattice 2^n Size & Square-Free Dn Rule"
      ]
