    "name": "Pigeonhole Principle",
    "category": "Set Theory, Relations & Algebraic Structures",
    "kind": "technique",
    "summary": "Fundamental non-constructive existence theorem: 1. Basic PHP: If $k+1$ or more objects are placed into $k$ boxes, at least one box contains $\\ge 2$ objects; 2. Generalized PHP: If $N$ objects are placed into $k$ boxes, AT LEAST ONE box contains $\\ge \\lceil N / k \\rceil$ objects, and at least one box contains $\\le \\lfloor N / k \\rfloor$ objects; 3. Minimum Objects to Guarantee $r$ in same box: $N = k(r-1) + 1$; 4. Erd\u0151s-Szekeres Theorem: Any sequence of $n^2+1$ distinct real numbers contains a monotonic subsequence of length $n+1$.",
    "formula": "\\text{At least one box contains } \\ge \\left\\lceil \\frac{N}{k} \\right\\rceil \\text{ objects} \\quad | \\quad \\text{To guarantee } r: N = k(r-1) + 1",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{Generalized PHP: Maximum box occupancy } \\ge \\lceil N / k \\rceil",
      "\\text{Guaranteed Threshold: To ensure at least } r \\text{ items in same box } \\implies N = k(r-1) + 1",
      "\\text{Subsequence Length (Erd\u0151s-Szekeres): Sequence of length } a \\cdot b + 1 \\implies \\text{Monotonic subsequence of length } a+1",
      "\\text{Modular Difference: In any set of } n+1 \\text{ integers, at least two have identical remainder mod } n"
    ],
    "complexity": "Proof Verification: $O(1)$ calculation of ceiling ratio $\\lceil N / k \\rceil$",
    "codeSnippet": "-- Classic GATE PHP Problems:\n-- Q: Min cards drawn from standard deck (52 cards, 4 suits) to guarantee 3 of same suit?\n-- Solution: k = 4 suits, r = 3 target cards\n-- N = k(r - 1) + 1 = 4(3 - 1) + 1 = 4(2) + 1 = 9 cards!\n-- Q: In group of 367 people, at least two share birthday: ceil(367 / 366) = 2!",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"25\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Generalized PHP</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\u2308N / k\u2309 in at least one box</text><rect x=\"245\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#22C55E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Guarantee Threshold</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">N = k(r - 1) + 1</text></svg>",
