      "\\text{Wheel Graph } W_n: |V| = n+1, \\quad |E| = 2n \\; (1 \\text{ vertex of degree } n, \\; n \\text{ vertices of degree } 3)",
      "\\text{Hypercube } Q_n: |V| = 2^n, \\quad |E| = n 2^{n-1}, \\quad \\deg(v) = n \\; (n\\text{-regular and Bipartite!})",
      "\\text{Self-Complementary Graph: } G \\cong \\overline{G} \\implies |E| = \\frac{n(n-1)}{4} \\implies n \\equiv 0 \\text{ or } 1 \\pmod 4"
