      "\\text{Contrapositive: } P \\to Q \\equiv \\neg Q \\to \\neg P; \\quad \\neg(P \\to Q) \\equiv P \\land \\neg Q",
      "\\text{Quantifiers: } \\neg \\forall x P(x) \\equiv \\exists x \\neg P(x); \\quad \\exists y \\forall x P(x, y) \\implies \\forall x \\exists y P(x, y)",
      "\\text{Reflexive Relations: } 2^{n(n-1)}; \\quad \\text{Symmetric: } 2^{n(n+1)/2}; \\quad \\text{Antisymmetric: } 2^n \\cdot 3^{n(n-1)/2}",
      "\\text{Stars and Bars (Non-Negative): } \\binom{n+k-1}{k-1}; \\quad \\text{Derangements: } !n = n! \\sum \\frac{(-1)^k}{k!}",
      "\\text{Catalan Numbers: } C_n = \\frac{1}{n+1} \\binom{2n}{n} \\; (1, 1, 2, 5, 14, 42, 132)",
      "\\text{Handshaking: } \\sum \\deg(v) = 2|E|; \\quad \\text{Tree: } |E| = n - 1; \\quad \\text{Labeled Trees: } n^{n-2}",
      "\\text{Bipartite Theorem: No odd cycles; } \\quad \\text{Planar Bound: } E \\le 3V - 6; \\quad \\text{Euler: } V - E + F = 2",
