    "codeSnippet": "-- 3-Set Venn Region Filling Strategy:\n-- 1. Always start by placing the center 3-way intersection: n(A \u2229 B \u2229 C)\n-- 2. Subtract center to fill the three 2-way exclusive intersections\n-- 3. Subtract all intersections to get the 3 exclusive single-set regions\n-- Total = Sum of all 7 non-overlapping sub-regions + Outside None",
