      "\\text{Pie Chart Percentage to Degree: } \\text{Angle} = \\text{Percentage} \\times 3.6^\\circ",
      "\\text{Percentage Growth: } \\frac{\\text{Value}_{2024} - \\text{Value}_{2020}}{\\text{Value}_{2020}} \\times 100\\%",
      "\\text{Ratio of Pie Sectors: } \\frac{\\text{Sector } A}{\\text{Sector } B} = \\frac{\\theta_A}{\\theta_B} \\; (\\text{Total value cancels out!})"
