    "category": "Relational Algebra & SQL",
    "kind": "definition",
    "summary": "Representation of missing, unknown, or inapplicable data. Comparisons with NULL yield `UNKNOWN` in 3-Valued Logic (`TRUE`, `FALSE`, `UNKNOWN`). Truth tables: `UNKNOWN AND TRUE = UNKNOWN`, `UNKNOWN OR TRUE = TRUE`, `NOT(UNKNOWN) = UNKNOWN`. `WHERE` clause accepts rows ONLY when predicate evaluates strictly to `TRUE`.",
    "formula": "\\text{NULL Comparison: } x = \\text{NULL} \\implies \\text{UNKNOWN} \\quad (\\text{Use } x \\text{ IS NULL})",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{UNKNOWN AND TRUE} = \\text{UNKNOWN}, \\quad \\text{UNKNOWN AND FALSE} = \\text{FALSE}",
      "\\text{UNKNOWN OR TRUE} = \\text{TRUE}, \\quad \\text{UNKNOWN OR FALSE} = \\text{UNKNOWN}",
      "\\text{NOT(UNKNOWN)} = \\text{UNKNOWN}",
      "\\text{WHERE Clause Filter: Emits row } \\iff \\text{Condition} = \\text{TRUE (Rejects FALSE and UNKNOWN)}"
    ],
    "complexity": "Arithmetic Evaluation: Any arithmetic operation on NULL ($x + \\text{NULL}$) produces NULL",
    "codeSnippet": "-- Testing 3-Valued Logic in SQL:\nSELECT * FROM Students WHERE Age = NULL;     -- Returns 0 rows (UNKNOWN rejected!)\nSELECT * FROM Students WHERE Age IS NULL;    -- Correct syntax to find NULLs\nSELECT * FROM Students WHERE Age > 20 OR Age <= 20; -- Drops rows where Age IS NULL!",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"25\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3-Valued Logic</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TRUE, FALSE, UNKNOWN</text><rect x=\"245\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#EF4444\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#EF4444\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">x = NULL Trap</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Evaluates to UNKNOWN (Use IS NULL)</text></svg>",
    "commonTraps": [
      "`Age > 20 OR Age <= 20` does NOT return all rows! If `Age` is NULL, both comparisons yield `UNKNOWN`, `UNKNOWN OR UNKNOWN = UNKNOWN`, and the row is REJECTED.",
      "`NULL = NULL` evaluates to `UNKNOWN`, NOT `TRUE`."
    ],
