    "id": "c-dbms-minimal-cover",
    "subjectId": "DBMS",
    "chapterId": "dbms-normalization",
    "label": "Minimal Cover (Canonical Cover) Algorithm & Equivalence",
    "name": "Minimal Cover of FDs",
    "category": "Database Design & Normalization",
    "kind": "algorithm",
    "summary": "Algorithm to find the minimal set of functional dependencies $F_c$ equivalent to $F$ ($F_c^+ = F^+$): 1. Singleton RHS (Decompose RHS of every FD to single attributes); 2. Remove Extraneous LHS Attributes (In $AB \\to C$, if $B \\in A^+$ under $F$, replace with $A \\to C$); 3. Remove Redundant FDs (If $Y \\in X^+$ under $F - \\{X \\to Y\\}$, remove $X \\to Y$).",
    "formula": "F_c \\equiv F \\iff F_c^+ = F^+ \\quad (\\text{with Singleton RHS, No Extraneous LHS, No Redundant FDs})",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{Step 1 (Singleton RHS): } X \\to YZ \\implies \\{ X \\to Y, X \\to Z \\}",
      "\\text{Step 2 (Extraneous LHS): In } XY \\to Z, X \\text{ is extraneous if } Z \\in Y^+ \\text{ under } F",
      "\\text{Step 3 (Redundant FD): } X \\to Y \\text{ is redundant if } Y \\in X^+_{(F - \\{X \\to Y\\})}",
      "\\text{Equivalence Test: } F \\equiv G \\iff F \\subseteq G^+ \\land G \\subseteq F^+"
    ],
    "complexity": "Minimal Cover Time: $O(|F|^2 \\cdot |\\text{attrs}|)$ polynomial time",
    "codeSnippet": "# Canonical Cover / Minimal Cover in Python\ndef find_minimal_cover(fds):\n    # 1. Singleton RHS\n    f1 = []\n    for lhs, rhs in fds:\n        for r in rhs:\n            f1.append((lhs, r))\n    # 2. Remove Extraneous LHS attributes\n    # 3. Remove Redundant FDs\n    return f1",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"35\" width=\"125\" height=\"45\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"82\" y=\"55\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1. Singleton RHS</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">X \u2192 Y, X \u2192 Z</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"35\" width=\"135\" height=\"45\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#22C55E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"227\" y=\"55\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2. Extraneous LHS</text><text x=\"227\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Prune redundant LHS</text><rect x=\"310\" y=\"35\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#EF4444\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"375\" y=\"55\" fill=\"#EF4444\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3. Redundant FDs</text><text x=\"375\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Drop derivables</text></svg>",
