    "codeSnippet": "// 2PL Execution Sequence:\n// Phase 1 (Growing): Lock-S(A), Lock-X(B), Lock-S(C) [All locks acquired]\n// Lock Point reached!\n// Phase 2 (Shrinking): Unlock(A), Unlock(B), Unlock(C) [Zero new locks acquired]",
