    "name": "Undecidable Problems Catalog",
    "category": "Decidability, Rice's Theorem & Complexity",
    "kind": "technique",
    "summary": "Curated catalog of recurring undecidable decision problems: 1. Halting Problem ($HALT_{TM}$); 2. State-Entry Problem (Does $M$ ever enter state $q$?); 3. Blank-Tape Halting (Does $M$ halt on empty tape?); 4. Language Emptiness of TM ($L(M) = \\emptyset$); 5. Language Regularity of TM ($L(M) \\in \\text{REG}$); 6. CFG Universality ($L(G) = \\Sigma^*$); 7. CFG Equivalence ($L(G_1) = L(G_2)$); 8. CFG Ambiguity; 9. Post Correspondence Problem (PCP); 10. Hilbert's 10th Problem (Diophantine equations).",
    "formula": "\\text{Famous Undecidables: } HALT_{TM}, \\; L(M)=\\emptyset, \\; L(M) \\in \\text{REG}, \\; L(G)=\\Sigma^*, \\; G \\text{ ambiguous}, \\; PCP",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{Halting on Blank Tape: UNDECIDABLE (RE - REC)}",
      "\\text{Does TM } M \\text{ accept ANY string of length } \\le 10 \\text{? UNDECIDABLE (by Rice's Theorem)}",
      "\\text{Does TM } M \\text{ take } \\le 100 \\text{ steps on string } w \\text{? DECIDABLE (Syntactic / Resource bounded)}",
      "\\text{Is } L(G_1) \\subseteq L(G_2) \\text{ for CFGs? UNDECIDABLE (Set containment of CFLs)}"
    ],
    "complexity": "GATE Pattern: Instantly recognize Decidable vs Undecidable questions without full reduction proofs",
    "codeSnippet": "-- Decidable vs Undecidable Examples:\n-- P1: Does a given DFA accept any string of length >= 10? --> DECIDABLE (Search DFA graph)\n-- P2: Does a given TM accept any string of length >= 10?  --> UNDECIDABLE (Rice's Theorem)\n-- P3: Is a given CFG ambiguous?                          --> UNDECIDABLE (PCP Reduction)",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"25\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#EF4444\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#EF4444\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CFG Undecidables</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">L(G)=\u03a3*, L1=L2, Ambiguity, L1\u2229L2=\u2205</text><rect x=\"245\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#EF4444\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#EF4444\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TM Undecidables</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Halting, Emptiness, Regularity, PCP</text></svg>",
