    "label": "Complexity Classes P and NP & Polynomial Verifiers",
    "name": "Complexity Classes P & NP",
    "category": "Decidability, Rice's Theorem & Complexity",
    "kind": "definition",
    "summary": "Time complexity classes for decidable decision problems: 1. Class P: Solvable by a Deterministic Turing Machine in polynomial time $O(n^k)$; 2. Class NP: Solvable by a Non-Deterministic TM in polynomial time $O(n^k)$ OR equivalently verifiable by a Deterministic TM in polynomial time given a polynomial-size certificate / witness $c$. Millennium Prize open question: $P = NP?$",
    "formula": "P = \\bigcup_{k \\ge 1} \\text{TIME}(n^k) \\quad \\subseteq \\quad NP = \\bigcup_{k \\ge 1} \\text{NTIME}(n^k)",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{Class P: Solvable in polynomial time } O(n^k) \\; (\\text{e.g. 2-SAT, Shortest Path, Minimum Spanning Tree, Matrix Mult})",
      "\\text{Class NP: Verifiable in polynomial time given certificate } c \\; (\\text{e.g. 3-SAT, Hamiltonian Path, Traveling Salesperson})",
      "\\text{Containment: } P \\subseteq NP \\subseteq PSPACE \\subseteq EXPTIME",
      "\\text{Co-NP: Complement of problems in NP (No-instances have polynomial certs)}"
    ],
    "complexity": "Millennium Question: P vs NP (Most computer scientists believe $P \\ne NP$)",
    "codeSnippet": "# Polynomial-Time Verifier for Hamiltonian Path in Python\ndef verify_hamiltonian_path(graph, vertex_sequence):\n    # Certificate is vertex_sequence\n    # Verification in O(V) time:\n    if len(vertex_sequence) != len(graph.vertices): return False\n    if len(set(vertex_sequence)) != len(graph.vertices): return False\n    for i in range(len(vertex_sequence) - 1):\n        if not graph.has_edge(vertex_sequence[i], vertex_sequence[i+1]):\n            return False\n    return True # Verified in linear time -> Problem is in NP!",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><ellipse cx=\"230\" cy=\"65\" rx=\"180\" ry=\"48\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">Class NP</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"65\" r=\"32\" fill=\"#0F172A\" stroke=\"#22C55E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Class P</text></svg>",
