    "codeSnippet": "// Basic Instruction Fetch Micro-operations in C/RTL:\n// Step 1: MAR = PC\n// Step 2: MDR = Memory[MAR]; PC = PC + 4; // Parallel increment\n// Step 3: IR = MDR\n// Step 4: Decode(IR.opcode)",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"25\" y=\"40\" width=\"85\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#38BDF8\"/><text x=\"67\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#0F172A\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1. FETCH</text><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"57\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"57\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"135\" y=\"40\" width=\"85\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#22C55E\"/><text x=\"177\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#0F172A\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2. DECODE</text><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"57\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"57\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"245\" y=\"40\" width=\"85\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#F59E0B\"/><text x=\"287\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#0F172A\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3. EXECUTE</text><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"57\" x2=\"355\" y2=\"57\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"355\" y=\"40\" width=\"80\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#EF4444\"/><text x=\"395\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4. INTERRUPT</text></svg>",
