    "complexity": "Hardware Rounding: 3 extra bits (GRS) prevent cumulative precision loss",
    "codeSnippet": "# Guard, Round, Sticky Bit Generator in Python\ndef generate_grs(shifted_out_bits):\n    # shifted_out_bits = '101000'\n    g = int(shifted_out_bits[0]) if len(shifted_out_bits) >= 1 else 0\n    r = int(shifted_out_bits[1]) if len(shifted_out_bits) >= 2 else 0\n    s = 1 if any(b == '1' for b in shifted_out_bits[2:]) else 0\n    return g, r, s",
