    "name": "Cache Write Policies",
    "category": "Memory Hierarchy & Cache",
    "kind": "definition",
    "summary": "Policies for handling CPU memory writes. Write-Through updates both cache and main memory simultaneously (uses Write Buffer to reduce stalls). Write-Back updates cache only, setting a Dirty bit; main memory is updated ONLY when dirty block is evicted. Paired with Write-Allocate (fetches block on write miss) or No-Write-Allocate.",
    "formula": "\\text{Write-Through + No-Write-Allocate} \\quad | \\quad \\text{Write-Back + Write-Allocate (Standard Pairing)}",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{Write-Through: Memory always has latest data (Consistent, simple, high bus traffic)}",
      "\\text{Write-Back: Writes occur at cache speed; memory traffic reduced by } 70-90\\%",
      "\\text{Write-Allocate (Fetch-on-Write): Loads block into cache on write miss (used with Write-Back)}",
      "\\text{No-Write-Allocate (Write-Around): Writes directly to RAM on write miss without loading cache (used with Write-Through)}"
    ],
    "complexity": "Bus Bandwidth: Write-Back uses significantly less memory bus bandwidth than Write-Through",
    "codeSnippet": "// Write-Back Eviction Logic in C:\n// if (cache_line.valid && cache_line.dirty) {\n//     write_block_to_ram(cache_line.tag, cache_line.data); // Flush modified data\n// }\n// load_new_block_from_ram(new_tag);",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"25\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Write-Through</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Updates Cache &amp; RAM simultaneously</text><rect x=\"245\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#22C55E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Write-Back</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Updates Cache only (Dirty bit)</text></svg>",
