      "\\text{Too Large Block: Fewer lines in cache } \\implies \\text{Increases Conflict & Capacity Misses}",
      "\\text{False Sharing: In multi-core, two cores modifying independent variables in the SAME cache block trigger ping-pong invalidations}"
