    "id": "c-coa-pipelining",
    "subjectId": "Computer Organization & Architecture",
    "chapterId": "coa-pipeline",
    "label": "Instruction Pipelining Principles, Cycle Time & Ideal Speedup",
    "name": "Pipelining Principles",
    "category": "Instruction Pipelining",
    "kind": "definition",
    "summary": "Implementation technique decomposing instruction execution into $k$ sequential stages (e.g. IF, ID, EX, MEM, WB). Clock period $\\tau$ is bounded by the slowest stage plus interface register delay $d$: $\\tau = \\max(t_i) + d$. Ideal speedup for $n$ instructions on $k$ stages approaches $k$ as $n \\to \\infty$.",
    "formula": "\\text{Clock Period: } \\tau = \\max_{1 \\le i \\le k}(t_i) + d, \\quad \\text{Execution Time for } n \\text{ instructions: } (k + n - 1)\\tau",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{Non-Pipelined Time: } T_{\\text{non-pipe}} = n \\times \\sum_{i=1}^k t_i",
      "\\text{Pipelined Time: } T_{\\text{pipe}} = (k + n - 1) \\times (\\max(t_i) + d)",
      "\\text{Speedup: } S = \\frac{T_{\\text{non-pipe}}}{T_{\\text{pipe}}} = \\frac{n \\cdot \\sum t_i}{(k + n - 1)(\\max(t_i) + d)} \\xrightarrow{n \\to \\infty} \\frac{\\sum t_i}{\\max(t_i) + d} \\le k",
      "\\text{Throughput: } \\text{TP} = \\frac{n}{(k + n - 1)\\tau} \\xrightarrow{n \\to \\infty} \\frac{1}{\\tau} \\text{ instructions/sec}"
    ],
    "complexity": "Ideal Throughput: 1 instruction completed per clock cycle ($\\text{CPI} = 1$)",
    "codeSnippet": "# Pipeline Speedup Calculator in Python\ndef pipeline_speedup(stage_delays, reg_delay, n_instructions):\n    k = len(stage_delays)\n    t_non_pipe = n_instructions * sum(stage_delays)\n    tau = max(stage_delays) + reg_delay\n    t_pipe = (k + n_instructions - 1) * tau\n    speedup = t_non_pipe / t_pipe\n    return speedup, tau",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 130\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"130\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"25\" y=\"20\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#38BDF8\"/><text x=\"57\" y=\"39\" fill=\"#0F172A\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">IF</text><rect x=\"95\" y=\"20\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#22C55E\"/><text x=\"127\" y=\"39\" fill=\"#0F172A\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ID</text><rect x=\"165\" y=\"20\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#EF4444\"/><text x=\"197\" y=\"39\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">EX</text><rect x=\"235\" y=\"20\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#F59E0B\"/><text x=\"267\" y=\"39\" fill=\"#0F172A\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">MEM</text><rect x=\"305\" y=\"20\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#A855F7\"/><text x=\"337\" y=\"39\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">WB</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"85\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Clock Period \u03c4 = max(stage delays) + buffer delay</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"105\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ideal Speedup S = k (as n \u2192 \u221e)</text></svg>",
    "commonTraps": [
      "Pipeline clock period $\\tau$ is determined strictly by the SLOWEST stage delay, NOT the average stage delay.",
      "Buffer/Latch delay $d$ MUST be added to each stage in pipelined execution.",
      "First instruction takes $k$ cycles to complete; subsequent instructions complete at 1 per cycle in ideal conditions."
    ],
