    "summary": "Top-down parsing implementation where each non-terminal variable is implemented as a dedicated C/programming function. Predictive Recursive Descent: Uses lookahead symbol to make deterministic branch choices without backtracking (requires LL(1) grammar). General Recursive Descent: Uses backtracking when choices fail (expensive, exponential worst-case time).",
