    "summary": "Master relationship between the four LR parsing families: Expressive Power containment: $\\text{LR(0)} \\subsetneq \\text{SLR(1)} \\subsetneq \\text{LALR(1)} \\subsetneq \\text{CLR(1)}$. State Count relationship: $|Q_{\\text{LR(0)}}| = |Q_{\\text{SLR(1)}}| = |Q_{\\text{LALR(1)}}| \\le |Q_{\\text{CLR(1)}}|$. Also $\\text{LL(1)} \\subsetneq \\text{LR(1)}$.",
    "formula": "\\text{LR(0)} \\subsetneq \\text{SLR(1)} \\subsetneq \\text{LALR(1)} \\subsetneq \\text{CLR(1)} \\quad | \\quad |Q_{\\text{LR(0)}}| = |Q_{\\text{SLR(1)}}| = |Q_{\\text{LALR(1)}}| \\le |Q_{\\text{CLR(1)}}|",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{Power: Every LR(0) grammar is SLR(1); Every SLR(1) is LALR(1); Every LALR(1) is CLR(1)}",
      "\\text{State Count: Number of states in LR(0), SLR(1), and LALR(1) is ALWAYS IDENTICAL}",
      "\\text{LL(1) vs LR(1): } LL(1) \\subsetneq LR(1) \\; (\\text{LR(1) is strictly more powerful than LL(1)})",
      "\\text{LL(1) vs SLR(1): Incomparable! (Some LL(1) are not SLR(1), some SLR(1) are not LL(1))}"
    ],
    "complexity": "Diagnostic Rule: If grammar is SLR(1), it is GUARANTEED to be LALR(1) and CLR(1)",
    "codeSnippet": "-- Hierarchy Decision Rules:\n-- 1. Grammar is LR(0)   ==> It is AUTOMATICALLY SLR(1), LALR(1), and CLR(1)!\n-- 2. Grammar is SLR(1)  ==> It is AUTOMATICALLY LALR(1) and CLR(1)!\n-- 3. Grammar is LALR(1) ==> It is AUTOMATICALLY CLR(1)!\n-- 4. Grammar is NOT CLR(1) ==> It is NOT parsable by ANY deterministic LR parser.",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 130\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"130\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"65\" r=\"58\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CLR(1)</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"68\" r=\"44\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#22C55E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"35\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LALR(1)</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"72\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#F59E0B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"52\" fill=\"#F59E0B\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">SLR(1)</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"78\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#EF4444\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LR(0)</text></svg>",
