    "kind": "definition",
    "summary": "An SDD is S-Attributed if EVERY attribute in the grammar is a SYNTHESIZED attribute. Can be naturally evaluated during bottom-up LR parsing by maintaining an extra attribute stack alongside the parser stack: semantic action is executed whenever a REDUCE operation is performed. Every S-Attributed SDD is strictly L-Attributed ($S\\text{-Attributed} \\subset L\\text{-Attributed}$).",
    "formula": "\\text{S-Attributed SDD: Contains ONLY Synthesized Attributes} \\implies \\text{Evaluated during Bottom-Up LR Reductions}",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{S-Attributed SDT: All semantic actions are placed at the EXTREME RIGHT END of productions } (A \\to \\alpha \\; \\{ \\text{action} \\})",
      "\\text{Attribute Stack: Value of } \\$ \\text{ is computed from } \\$1, \\$2, \\dots, \\$k \\text{ on reduction}",
      "\\text{Containment: } S\\text{-Attributed} \\subsetneq L\\text{-Attributed} \\subsetneq \\text{All SDDs}"
    ],
    "complexity": "Evaluation: 0 extra passes (computed synchronously during LR parsing)",
    "codeSnippet": "-- S-Attributed Postfix Translation Scheme:\n-- E -> E1 '+' T  { print('+'); }\n-- E -> T\n-- T -> T1 '*' F  { print('*'); }\n-- T -> F\n-- F -> '(' E ')'\n-- F -> id        { print(id.name); }\n-- Evaluates input 'a + b * c' directly to postfix 'a b c * +' on bottom-up reductions!",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"25\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#22C55E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">S-Attributed SDD</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ONLY Synthesized Attributes</text><rect x=\"245\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"75\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LR Parser Stack</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Executed on REDUCE ($$ = $1 + $3)</text></svg>",
    "commonTraps": [
      "In S-Attributed SDTs, all semantic actions must be at the RIGHT-END of productions.",
      "Every S-Attributed definition is also L-Attributed, but NOT vice-versa."
    ],
