    "summary": "Organization of target machine logical address space during program execution: 1. Code Segment (Static, read-only executable instructions); 2. Static / Data Segment (Global variables, static variables, constants); 3. Heap Segment (Dynamic memory allocation via `malloc`/`new`, grows upwards); 4. Stack Segment (Activation records / stack frames for function calls, local variables, grows downwards).",
    "formula": "\\text{Address Space: } \\text{Code (Low)} \\to \\text{Static Data} \\to \\text{Heap } (\\downarrow) \\; \\longleftrightarrow \\; (\\uparrow) \\text{ Stack (High Memory)}",
    "keyFormulae": [
      "\\text{Static Allocation: Memory bound at COMPILE TIME (No recursion, fixed sizes, Fortran 77)}",
      "\\text{Stack Allocation: LIFO allocation in activation records (Supports RECURSION, C/C++/Java)}",
      "\\text{Heap Allocation: Arbitrary allocation/deallocation at runtime (Requires Garbage Collection or manual free)}"
    ],
    "complexity": "Stack Push/Pop: $O(1)$ stack pointer register adjustment",
    "codeSnippet": "-- Memory Layout of a C Program:\n-- High Memory (0xFFFFFFFF)\n--   [ Stack Segment ]     <-- Grows Downwards (Local vars, Activation Records)\n--         | \n--         v\n--         ^\n--         | \n--   [ Heap Segment ]      <-- Grows Upwards (malloc/calloc/free)\n--   [ BSS (Uninitialized Static Data) ]\n--   [ Data (Initialized Static Data) ]\n--   [ Text / Code Segment ] <-- Read-only instructions\n-- Low Memory (0x00000000)",
    "imageUrl": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 130\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"460\" height=\"130\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0F172A\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"20\" width=\"380\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"34\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Stack (Grows Down \u2193)</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"45\" width=\"380\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#22C55E\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"59\" fill=\"#22C55E\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Heap (Grows Up \u2191)</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"70\" width=\"380\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#F59E0B\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"84\" fill=\"#F59E0B\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Static / Global Data</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"95\" width=\"380\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"109\" fill=\"#CBD5E1\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Code / Text Segment</text></svg>",
